BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Government
SUMMARY:Public Health Mobile Team: AB-Tech MANNA Community Market
LOCATION:A-B Tech<br>70 Fernihurst Dr\, Asheville\, NC 28801<br><br>Loca
 ted in the parking lot behind the Magnolia building
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T123000
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:FALSE
URL:https://abtech.edu/student-resources/food-pantry
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Event Type";ID=21;TYPE=number:Default Templat
 e
DTSTAMP:20250520T170509Z
DESCRIPTION:Link: https://abtech.edu/student-resources/food-pantry<br><b
 r>Join the Mobile Team at the AB-Tech MANNA Community Market for free gr
 oceries and access to various local resources. The market offers free&#1
 60\;grocery staples\, fresh produce\, and other perishables from&#160\;M
 ANNA Foodbank. This service is open to the community as well as A-B Tech
  students and employees.<br><br><strong>The BCHHS Mobile Team will offer
  the following services</strong>&#160\;(all free\, regardless of insuran
 ce status\, unless otherwise noted):<ul> <li><strong>Immunization/Vaccin
 e Reviews\, Education\, and Printouts</strong>	</li><li><strong>Free Imm
 unizations:&#160\;</strong><em>Insurance accepted but not required</em>	
 <ul> <li>Influenza/Flu (ages 6+ months)		</li><li>COVID (ages 12+ years)
 		</li><li>Tdap (Tetanus\, Diphtheria\, Pertussis)		</li><li>Hepatitis A
 		</li><li>Hepatitis B		</li><li>Mpox		</li><li>Shingles (ages 50+): <em
 >Requires insurance or Patient Assistance approval (application availabl
 e)</em>	</li></ul>		</li><li><strong>Rapid Testing</strong> (HIV\, Hepat
 itis C\, Syphilis)	</li><li><strong>STI Testing&#160\;</strong>(Chlamydi
 a\, Gonorrhea\, Hepatitis B)	</li><li><strong>Harm Reduction Services &a
 mp\; Resources</strong>	</li><li><strong>Peer Support Services</strong>	
 </li><li><strong>Connection to Local Health and Social Service Resources
 </strong>	</li><li><strong>Health Education</strong></li></ul><em><stron
 g>**Servicios disponibles en espa&#241\;ol**</strong></em>
CATEGORIES:Mobile Team
UID:http://uid.trumba.com/event/182412907
X-TRUMBA-LINK:https://www.buncombecounty.org/countycenter/events-calenda
 r.aspx?trumbaEmbed=view%3Devent%26eventid%3D182412907
END:VEVENT
