DTSTAMP:20230818T161720Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>The Home and Community Care Block Grant Advisory Committ
 ee meets monthly.&#160\; The Home and Community Care Block Grant Advisor
 y Committee makes grant recommendations to the Board of Commissioners re
 garding allocations of Home and Community Care Block Grant funding and C
 ounty Aging Services funding yearly. &#160\;During the other months\, th
 e Committee reviews provider spending\, annual reporting\, and discusses
  gaps within the aging services network.&#160\; This is an open meeting 
 and anyone is welcome to listen in.&#160\;
CATEGORIES:Age Friendly
